px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"/page/Category:Yellow_augments\" title=\"Category:Yellow augments\">Yellow</a> and <a href=\"/page/Category:Colorless_augments\" title=\"Category:Colorless augments\">Colorless</a></span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon augment green\"><span class=\"title\"><a href=\"/page/Augment_Slot\" title=\"Augment Slot\">Green Augment Slot</a></span><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"/page/Category:Blue_augments\" title=\"Category:Blue augments\">Blue</a>, <a href=\"/page/Category:Green_augments\" title=\"Category:Green augments\">Green</a>, <a href=\"/page/Category:Yellow_augments\" title=\"Category:Yellow augments\">Yellow</a>, and <a href=\"/page/Category:Colorless_augments\" title=\"Category:Colorless augments\">Colorless</a></span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Named_item_sets#Mountainskin_Set\" title=\"Named item sets\">Mountainskin Set</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Named_item_sets#Mountainskin_Set\" title=\"Named item sets\">Mountainskin Set</a>:</b> While wearing both items from the Mountainskin Set, you gain:<br />+30 Artifact bonus to Acid Spell Power<br />+6% Artifact bonus to Acid Spell Lore<br />When struck, you will occasionally have the Stoneskin spell cast on you.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Mythic_Boost\" title=\"Mythic Boost\">Mythic Cloak Boost</a> +1 or +3<span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Mythic_Boost\" title=\"Mythic Boost\">Mythic Cloak Boost</a> +1 or +3:</b> +1 or +3 <a href=\"/page/Mythic_bonus\" title=\"Mythic bonus\">Mythic bonus</a> to <a href=\"/page/Physical_Resistance_Rating\" title=\"Physical Resistance Rating\">Physical</a> and <a href=\"/page/Magical_Resistance_Rating\" title=\"Magical Resistance Rating\">Magical</a> Resistance Ratings.<br />(<i>This is a rare enchantment that does not show up on all drops of this item.</i>)</span></span></li></ul>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF; vertical-align: middle;\" rowspan=\"4\" align=\"center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Cloak_of_the_Mountain.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Cloak_of_the_Mountain.png/420px-Cloak_of_the_Mountain.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"420\" height=\"422\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Cloak_of_the_Mountain.png 1.5x\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#DDAAFF\">Upgradeable?\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EEDDFF\"><a href=\"/page/Cauldron_of_Cadence\" title=\"Cauldron of Cadence\">Cauldron of Cadence</a> to <a href=\"/page/Item:Set_Augment:_Esoterica\" title=\"Item:Set Augment: Esoterica\">Set Augment: Esoterica</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF;\">Description\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\"><i>This dark gray cloak seems to ripple, despite being carved of smooth gray stone.</i>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF;\">Tips\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\">\n<p>Can be crafted into the <a href=\"/page/Item:Set_Augment:_Esoterica\" title=\"Item:Set Augment: Esoterica\">Esoterica</a> <a href=\"/page/Augment_Slot#Set_augments\" title=\"Augment Slot\">set augment</a> for +3 Artifact Bonus to <a href=\"/page/Difficulty_Class#Spells\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Difficulty Class\">Spell DCs</a>.\n</p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260816154638\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.104 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.155 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 4602/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 33401/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 11244/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 31/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/200\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 4051/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/150\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n104.07%  140.604     60 Template:IO\n100.00%  135.099      1 Template:Named_item\n100.00%  135.099      1 -total\n 98.15%  132.594      1 Template:Named_Clothing\n 33.54%   45.316      2 Template:Lamannia_picture\n 32.96%   44.527      2 Template:IsLamannia\n 32.31%   43.654      2 Template:IsSpeculation\n 31.62%   42.717      2 Template:InCategory\n 27.39%   37.007     10 Template:Popup\n 13.29%   17.951      2 Template:Augment\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key ddowiki:pcache:idhash:72238-0!canonical and timestamp 20260816154638 